#. Tag: title
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; Edutainment"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kde; Edutainment Project offers children, families, and teachers some "
"educational programs. You can find applications to help you improve your "
"language skills and train your vocabulary, like &kvoctrain; and &kwordquiz;; "
"or Scientific programs, like the very advanced &kstars; (a planetarium) and "
"&kig; (interactive geometry), which will bring you to the edge of knowledge. "
"Have fun learning touch-typing with &ktouch;. Teachers will find an easy way "
"to make their lessons with &keduca;. You can find a complete list of &kde; "
"educational software on <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org\">the KDE-Edu "
"website</ulink>. What follows is an overview of a few of them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"View the handbook of each application by typing <userinput>help:/&lt;"
"appname&gt;</userinput> in &konqueror;'s Location Toolbar, or by selecting "
"it in &khelpcenter;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Improve your language skills"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "&khangman;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An easy-to-use application which implements the classical hangman game. You "
"can choose for the words to be from a particular topic and even choose from "
"a selection of difficulty levels. The program comes in twenty-four "
"languages, and is therefore quite ideal for learning the spelling of basic "
"nouns in other languages."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/khangman\">http://edu.kde.org/"
"khangman</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "&khangman; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "&klettres;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An application specially designed to help the user learn the alphabet of a "
"new language and then to learn to read simple syllables. Ideal for children, "
"or any person attempting to learn and familiarize themselves with a foreign "
"language's alphabet. A number of alphabets are currently supported."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/klettres\">http://edu.kde.org/"
"klettres</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "&klettres; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kanagram;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A simple mind-training game, in which you have to figure out the word that "
"has been given in the program. The letters from the word are disordered, and "
"from the given words you have to solve which word the letters might make, if "
"rearranged. Similar to the popular Countdown game as seen on Television."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kanagram\">http://edu.kde.org/"
"kanagram</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kanagram; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kverbos;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A simple way to learn and study Spanish verb forms. The program suggests a "
"verb and a tense and the user enters the different forms. The program "
"corrects the user input and gives feedback. The user can edit the list of "
"the verbs that can be studied and the program can build regular verb forms, "
"and the forms of the most important verb groups, by itself. Irregular verb "
"forms can be entered by the user."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kverbos\">http://edu.kde.org/"
"kverbos</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kverbos; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kvoctrain;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another advanced vocabulary training application, using the flash card "
"approach. <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/contrib/kvtml.php\">Vocabulary "
"files</ulink> can be downloaded and loaded into the application."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kvoctrain\">http://edu.kde.org/"
"kvoctrain</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kvoctrain; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A Japanese reference and learning tool. Words from both English and Japanese "
"can be looked up, and filtered, using the <application>Edict</application> "
"and <application>Kanjidic</application> dictionary protocols. Other features "
"in &kiten; include a few comprehensive search functions, a history of "
"searches, and a learning section which contains various different learning "
"modes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kiten\">http://edu.kde.org/kiten</"
"ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "&klatin;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A program to help revise Latin. There are vocabulary, grammar, and verb "
"testing sections. In addition there is a set of revision notes that can be "
"used for self-guided revision."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/klatin\">http://edu.kde.org/klatin</"
"ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "&klatin; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mathematics"
msgstr "Matematicas"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Several applications to help you with Mathematics and Geometry."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kbruch;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An application with several exercise types in order to enhance your "
"calculating with fractions. Different tasks include exercises to find the "
"sum of two fractions, the conversion of fractions into the respective "
"decimal, the comparison (with less than, more than) of fractions, and more."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kbruch\">http://edu.kde.org/kbruch</"
"ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kbruch; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kig;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A great application with interactive geometry. Ideal for teachers attempting "
"to draw a graph on the computer, or students who wish to find out more and "
"investigate with graphs and curves. Currently many things are supported, and "
"you can very easily construct several things from parabolas and hyperbolas, "
"to ellipses."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kig\">http://edu.kde.org/kig</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kig; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kpercentage;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Essentially an application to help you improve your skills in calculating "
"percentages. Different exercises are included, and there are varying "
"difficulty levels to target persons with varying abilities."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kpercentage\">http://edu.kde.org/"
"kpercentage</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kpercentage; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kmplot;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A mathematical function plotter. It has built in a powerful parser. You can "
"plot different functions simultaneously and combine their function terms to "
"build new functions. &kmplot; supports functions with parameters and "
"functions in polar coordinates. Several grid modes are possible and plots "
"may be printed with high precision in correct scale."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kmplot\">http://edu.kde.org/kmplot</"
"ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kmplot; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Science"
msgstr "Sciéncia"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kstars;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A desktop Planetarium for &kde;. It provides an accurate graphical "
"simulation of the night sky, from any location on Earth, at any date and "
"time. The display includes 130,000 stars, 13,000 deep-sky objects, all 8 "
"planets, the Sun and Moon, and thousands of comets and asteroids."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kstars\">http://edu.kde.org/kstars</"
"ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kstars; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A fully-featured periodic table application. It features a full list of all "
"elements, and extended information about each individual element. As well as "
"being able to view a basic overview, other features include being able to "
"view its chemical data, atomic model, energies, as well as a picture of the "
"element."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kalzium\">http://edu.kde.org/"
"kalzium</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "Teaching Tools"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid "&keduca;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A flash card application, which allows you to make interactive form-based "
"tests. It also currently comes with support to add servers from which you "
"can fetch tests. Several languages supported."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/keduca\">http://edu.kde.org/keduca</"
"ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid "&keduca; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "Divèrs"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ktouch;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An application for learning touch-typing. &ktouch; displays the keyboard on "
"the screen, and the color of the keys changes when they need to be "
"depressed. Text appears on the screen, and the user is asked to type it out. "
"A few lectures are contained in the program by default, with various "
"different difficulty levels."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/ktouch\">http://edu.kde.org/ktouch</"
"ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ktouch; Handbook"
msgstr ""

